sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Browser as Buyer Browser
    participant OrderServlet as OrderServlet (Controller)
    participant OrderService as OrderService (Service)
    participant Payment as PaymentStrategy (Strategy)
    participant CartDao as JdbcCartDao (DAO)
    participant OrderDao as JdbcOrderDao (DAO)
    participant DB as H2 Database

    Note over Browser,OrderServlet: 1. Place Order Request
    Browser->>OrderServlet: POST /buyer/orders (Session Cookie)
    activate OrderServlet

    OrderServlet->>OrderService: placeOrder(buyerId)
    activate OrderService

    OrderService->>CartDao: getItems(buyerId)
    activate CartDao
    CartDao->>DB: SELECT * FROM cart_items WHERE user_id = ?
    DB-->>CartDao: List<CartItem>
    CartDao-->>OrderService: List<CartItem>
    deactivate CartDao

    OrderService->>Payment: charge(buyerId, totalAmount)
    activate Payment
    Payment-->>OrderService: success (true)
    deactivate Payment

    OrderService->>OrderDao: placeOrder(buyerId)
    activate OrderDao

    Note over OrderDao,DB: Atomic Transaction (setAutoCommit=false)
    OrderDao->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    OrderDao->>DB: SELECT stock_qty FROM products WHERE id IN (...) FOR UPDATE
    DB-->>OrderDao: current stock
    OrderDao->>DB: INSERT INTO orders (buyer_id, total_amount, status) VALUES (?, ?, 'PENDING')
    DB-->>OrderDao: generated order_id
    OrderDao->>DB: INSERT INTO order_items (order_id, product_id, quantity, unit_price) VALUES (...)
    OrderDao->>DB: UPDATE products SET stock_qty = stock_qty - ? WHERE id = ?
    OrderDao->>DB: DELETE FROM cart_items WHERE user_id = ?
    OrderDao->>DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION

    OrderDao-->>OrderService: OrderSummaryDTO
    deactivate OrderDao

    OrderService-->>OrderServlet: OrderSummaryDTO
    deactivate OrderService

    OrderServlet-->>Browser: 302 Redirect to /buyer/orders?placed=1
    deactivate OrderServlet

    Note over Browser,OrderServlet: 2. View Updated Orders
    Browser->>OrderServlet: GET /buyer/orders?placed=1
    activate OrderServlet
    OrderServlet->>OrderService: buyerOrders(buyerId)
    activate OrderService
    OrderService->>OrderDao: findByBuyer(buyerId)
    activate OrderDao
    OrderDao->>DB: SELECT * FROM orders WHERE buyer_id = ?
    DB-->>OrderDao: order records
    OrderDao-->>OrderService: List<OrderSummaryDTO>
    deactivate OrderDao
    OrderService-->>OrderServlet: List<OrderSummaryDTO>
    deactivate OrderService

    OrderServlet->>Browser: 200 OK (Render buyer/orders.jsp)
    deactivate OrderServlet
